            <ArticleTitle>Acupuncture treatment of discopathic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>315-22</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors present the effects of acupuncture in 50 patients showing discopathic pain. It is concluded that acupuncture treatment favours the reduction of drug consumption, and, implicitly, of iatrogenic pathology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
